        "paper_score_status": "not_verified",
        "deviations": [
          "Uniform-time L2 iterative reflow, fresh teacher-generated endpoint pairs, warm start and reset Adam. Full local TSAD inputs and fixed residual score; not original image/transfer reproduction. Controls match total epochs and architecture, not exact compute (reflow additionally generates ODE pairs). One-step distillation and original image-task experiments remain pending.",
          "No EMA; warm-start shared MLP with a fresh Adam at each reflow stage. Initial rectification retains the registered local CFM time/RNG convention.",
          "Couplings use as many generated pairs as full nonoverlapping training windows. Pair data, teacher states and per-stage metadata persist in checkpoint buffers."
        ],
        "data_citations": [
          "https://github.com/decisionintelligence/TAB"
        ]
      },
